[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     59[0m:[38;5;10m[49m (`mdcore.c:42`, `mdmain.c:38`) and by `mdmain.c:42`, so only `helper_call` and
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     60[0m:[38;5;10m[49m `main` vary with it — the other rows would be exact duplicates across the eight
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     61[0m:[38;5;10m[49m REPEAT values. They are nevertheless re-run in all 24 configurations by
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     62[0m:[38;5;10m[49m `run_all.sh`, so the un-pruned cross-product is covered too.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     63[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     64[0m:[38;5;10m[49m Every row uses **many randomized inputs with a fixed seed** (SplitMix64, biased
